{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1491534-what-does-heart-of-the-forest-reveal-about-werewolf-5th","id":1491534,"title":"What does Heart of the Forest reveal about Werewolf 5th?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-27T17:14:51-07:00","id":1491534,"title":"What does Heart of the Forest reveal about Werewolf 5th?","content":"With the release date for Werewolf 5th looming in the distance and seemingly not getting any closer, I've been trying to look over the internet and find out whatever information I can find. I heard that Heart of the Forest supposedly has a bunch of information about the upcoming W5, but as I haven't been able to get a copy of the game myself yet, I've been unable to really do much research myself.<br /> <br /> Does anyone else know what exactly Heart of the Forest brings to the table? What changes does the game make to existing Werewolf lore?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27528-just-some-guy","name":"Just Some Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T06:31:28-07:00","id":1491586,"title":"","content":"As far as I read (and gathered from playing the Demo) it is rather vague. Most things are from the POV of the NPCs one meets. As such it doesn't necessarily deliver absolute truths, but more viewpoints of the garou in the rural Polish area the story is set in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1008-heinrich","name":"heinrich","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1008_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T06:40:46-07:00","id":1491587,"title":"","content":"While a good game, Hearth of the forest doesn't tell you absolutely anything other that a few generic pieces of lore, you have a few tribes trying to prevent the destruction of a forest, that's it, nothing new about the tribes themselves, the breeds likewise are kept standard and generic, one of the characters is Lupus but aside from that nothing new.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27142-newb95","name":"Newb95","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-28T16:41:57-07:00","id":1491676,"title":"","content":"Not much. I've gone through two playthroughs, and from what I could see it presents certain setting assumptions.<br /> - there are multiple multi-tribal packs around a forest in Poland, but no Caern<br /> - they all hate Get because Get were Nazis and the Get are now a excised tribe<br /> - you play a Polish descendant American whose blood is that of the Get<br /> - Umbra is only shown through visions, not actual travel<br /> - you pick your own tribe through Visions and choices, and you can choose to become a Get by going full murderhobo and antagonising the other packs<br /> <br /> <br /> Honestly it's very little actual details, our top source of info is still<a href=\"https://youtu.be/2L9Cj3VMHzw\" target=\"_blank\"> the Achilli interview from last October.</a><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:arial\">What doesn't kill you, makes you...<i> stranger</i>.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1182-asmodai","name":"Asmodai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1182_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2989"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}